B.a8C=new A.c5("Fuel Type","Select the fuel grade. Jet A-1 (0.800 kg/L) is the international standard. Jet A (0.804 kg/L) is common in the US. JP-8 is the military equivalent of Jet A-1. Reference densities are at 15 \xb0C and corrected automatically for temperature.",null)
B.a8S=new A.c5("Units","Switch between kilograms (kg), pounds (lb) and litres (L). Changing units automatically converts any values already entered.",null)
B.a8k=new A.c5("Fuel Temperature","Enter the actual fuel temperature in \xb0C. Tap the cloud icon to fetch the current outside air temperature based on your IP location \u2014 edit the field manually to clear it. Accurate temperature improves density correction.",null)
B.a8n=new A.c5("Fuel on Board & Desired Load","Enter the current fuel quantity and the target load after refuelling. Tap a preset chip to fill the desired field instantly. Long-press a chip to edit its value \u2014 changes are saved between sessions.",null)
B.a8D=new A.c5("Result","Shows the fuel to add or defuel in litres, kg, US gallons, imperial gallons and pounds, along with the effective density used. Tap Share to send the result via any messaging or notes app.",null)
